==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], Spitting Death was an Insane stage. This was most likely a translation error.
*Spitting Death's Japanese name, Aku Shoku Toiki (悪色吐息, "Evil-colored Breath"), is a pun: 悪色 ''aku shoku'' literally translates to "evil color", but also sounds identical to 悪食, meaning "eating things that are not normally eaten", or "eating forbidden food" in Buddhist contexts.
**Obviously, "Evil-colored Breath" refers to the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]-blue flames that the [[Malevolent King Dragon Cat]]s spew from their mouths.
*Prior to [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], the enemy base had 1,550,000 HP instead of 2,500,000.

